msgstr "Symptôme"

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/troubleshooting/nvidia_slow_response.rst:14
msgid ""
"Qwen3-32B on one GPU keeps its memory allocated and utilization near 100%, while "
"Qwen2.5-VL on another GPU responds normally. Even a short probe waits; one recorded "
"greeting returned about 40 minutes later as GPU utilization fell."
msgstr ""
"Qwen3-32B sur un GPU conserve sa mémoire allouée et une utilisation proche de 100 %, "
"tandis que Qwen2.5-VL sur un autre GPU répond normalement. Même une courte requête de"
" test reste en attente ; une salutation consignée a obtenu une réponse environ 40 "
"minutes plus tard, au moment où l'utilisation du GPU diminuait."

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/troubleshooting/nvidia_slow_response.rst
msgid "Observed"
msgstr "Observé"

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/troubleshooting/nvidia_slow_response.rst:18
msgid ""
"Another model on the same machine remained responsive. High GPU utilization shows "
"active computation but does not distinguish many requests from one long-running "
"request."
msgstr ""
"Un autre modèle sur la même machine restait réactif. Une utilisation GPU élevée "
"indique un calcul actif, mais ne permet pas de distinguer de nombreuses requêtes "
"d'une seule requête de longue durée."

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/troubleshooting/nvidia_slow_response.rst
msgid "Hypothesis"
msgstr "Hypothèse"

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/troubleshooting/nvidia_slow_response.rst:19
msgid ""
"Long prompts, large token budgets, thinking output or a queue may occupy this model "
"instance. The root cause was not confirmed in the record."
msgstr ""
"Des invites longues, des budgets de tokens importants, une sortie de réflexion "
"(thinking) ou une file d'attente peuvent occuper cette instance du modèle. La cause "
"racine n'a pas été confirmée dans l'enregistrement."

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/troubleshooting/nvidia_slow_response.rst:22
msgid "Logs and request correlation"
msgstr "Journaux et corrélation des requêtes"

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/troubleshooting/nvidia_slow_response.rst:24
msgid ""
"In the recorded Xinference 1.0.3 context, chat entry and exit messages use DEBUG "
"logging. Model subprocess logs may differ from the worker's main log; absent chat "
"messages in that file do not prove the request never reached the model."
msgstr ""
"Dans le contexte consigné de Xinference 1.0.3, les messages d'entrée et de sortie du "
"chat utilisent la journalisation DEBUG. Les journaux des sous-processus du modèle "
"peuvent différer du journal principal du worker ; l'absence de messages de chat dans "
"ce fichier ne prouve pas que la requête n'a jamais atteint le modèle."

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/troubleshooting/nvidia_slow_response.rst:27
msgid "Mitigation and diagnostics"
msgstr "Atténuation et diagnostic"

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/troubleshooting/nvidia_slow_response.rst:29
msgid ""
"The notes recommend streaming, a bounded token budget, a unique request identifier "
"and disabling thinking where the engine supports it. The following is the recorded "
"client request configuration; keep client-specific fields in the format expected by "
"your SDK."
msgstr ""
"Les notes recommandent le streaming, un budget de tokens borné, un identifiant de "
"requête unique et la désactivation de la réflexion (thinking) lorsque le moteur le "
"permet. Voici la configuration de requête client consignée ; conservez les champs "
"propres au client dans le format attendu par votre SDK."

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/troubleshooting/nvidia_slow_response.rst:42
msgid ""
"Use a small ``request_limits`` value, such as 1 or 2, when reproducing the case. Add "
"concurrency, timeout and queue limits at the entry layer so short requests do not "
"wait indefinitely behind long ones."
msgstr ""
"Utilisez une petite valeur de  ``request_limits`` , comme 1 ou 2, lors de la "
"reproduction du cas. Ajoutez des limites de concurrence, de délai d'expiration et de "
"file d'attente au niveau du point d'entrée afin que les requêtes courtes n'attendent "
"pas indéfiniment derrière les longues."

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/troubleshooting/nvidia_slow_response.rst:45
msgid "Verification"
msgstr "Vérification"

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/troubleshooting/nvidia_slow_response.rst:47
msgid ""
"Compare the same prompt on an idle instance and under load. Correlate request "
"identifiers with model logs and record first-token latency, total latency and whether"
" output completes. Treat these measures as diagnostic evidence, not confirmation of "
"the proposed cause."
msgstr ""
"Comparez la même invite sur une instance inactive et sous charge. Corrélez les "
"identifiants de requête avec les journaux du modèle et notez la latence du premier "
"token, la latence totale et si la sortie se termine. Considérez ces mesures comme des"
" éléments de diagnostic, et non comme une confirmation de la cause supposée."

